{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05903","headline":"过太乙观贾生房 · 王维","name":"过太乙观贾生房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔余栖遯日，之子烟霞邻。\n共携松叶酒，俱篸竹皮巾。\n攀林遍岩洞，采药无冬春。\n谬以道门子，徵爲骖御臣。\n常恐丹液就，先我紫阳宾。\n夭促万涂尽，哀伤百虑新。\n迹峻不容俗，才多反累真。\n泣对双泉水，还山无主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}